# The keyboard in game (P7-C, docs/reference/performance.md "Input and frame
# rate"): legion's in-game parity game (random-map.script: seed 4242,
# 800x600x32, Renaissance), nothing selected, the pointer in the middle of
# the map so the edge does not scroll. Then:
#   - Up held for 1.0 s, then Down (back): the camera's look-at point
#     (0x918d48, 0x918d4c) before and after each, peeked; run_menus.py
#     compares the distance with Windows' camera speed (legion 0080). A
#     second is short of the map's edge at Windows' speed; Right reaches it;
#   - ] held for 0.2 s, then [: the zoom (0x918db0) goes in and back out,
#     within 0..1;
#   - W, A, S and D tapped, then typed (the key and its character as text, as
#     the windowed app delivers a real keyboard's): the input probe
#     (mods/inputprobe, RECOMP_EE_INPUT_PROBE) says which window messages,
#     hotkeys and sounds each made. Windows: A and D are "select the closest
#     aircraft" and play its "none" sound (0x3c2) once per press; W and S do
#     nothing with nothing selected.
# menus: alone (Start Game opens the game server: one at a time)
# menus: env RECOMP_EE_FORCE_SEED=4242
# menus: env RECOMP_EE_INPUT_PROBE={out}/probe.csv
# menus: seed --width 800 --height 600 --player-name Unknown1634
timeout 400000
pointer f32 [0x9197a8]+4 [0x9197a8]+8
hold 250
wait frames 30
moveby 1 1
wait 300

click 511 268                 # Single Player
wait change within 15000
wait 1000
click 748 145                 # Play Random Map
wait change within 20000
wait 1500
click 644 730                 # Start Game
wait size 800 600 within 60000
wait 15000                    # "Choose Civilization" or the game (random-map.script)
click 400 520
wait 2000
click 400 520
wait pixel 300 560 556666 tol 24 within 120000
wait 5000
move 400 300
wait 1000
dump in-game

log hold Up
peek 0x00918d48 2
key UP down
wait 1000
key UP up
peek 0x00918d48 2
wait 1000
log hold Down
peek 0x00918d48 2
key DOWN down
wait 1000
key DOWN up
peek 0x00918d48 2
wait 1000
log zoom
peek 0x00918db0 1             # the zoom, 0 in to 1 out: a game starts out at 1
key RBRACKET down             # ] zooms in, [ out, a step per pass like the arrows
wait 200
key RBRACKET up
peek 0x00918db0 1
wait 1000
key LBRACKET down
wait 200
key LBRACKET up
peek 0x00918db0 1
wait 1000
dump scrolled

log tap W
key W
wait 1500
log tap A
key A
wait 1500
log tap S
key S
wait 1500
log tap D
key D
wait 1500
log type w
type w
wait 1500
log type a
type a
wait 1500
log type s
type s
wait 1500
log type d
type d
wait 1500
log done
quit
